From eb084b9565b18b31d357552437b272b504af47fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:45:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plugins: overlays hidden in dungeons, the Shugo games, arenas

A plugin overlay (ui.overlay: the Map's overlay, the Inventory's limits)
hides while the player is in a dungeon, one of the Shugo festival's games
or an Incursion, or an arena, and comes back as it was on leaving. The
kind of zone comes from the game's zone frame (21 36), which every loading
screen brings; nothing is sent. Per plugin in Settings -> Plugins: "Hide
its overlay in dungeons", "... in Shugo games and Incursions", "... in
arenas", all on until turned off. In such a zone the overlay's header
button shows it anyway, until the next zone.
